OL,3,GNEWSATraffic, tourism and economy among
OL,4,Aelection concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents and business owners in Onchan
OL,7,Fhave said traffic, tourism and the cost
OL,8,Fof living are among their key concerns
OL,9,Fahead of the 2026 House of Keys
OL,10,Felection.
OL,12,FThe constituency has the second largest
OL,13,Fpopulation on the Isle of Man after
OL,14,FDouglas, and sits along the east coast.
OL,16,FSally Hellwich, who runs a family
OL,17,Ftravel business, has lived in Onchan
OL,18,Ffor 30 years. She said she had 'lived,
OL,19,Fworked, and breathed Onchan" and was
OL,20,F"sad" no candidates had considered
OL,21,Ftourism as a priority.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
