OL,3,GNEWSATraffic, tourism and economy among
OL,4,Aelection concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "I truly believe that tourism
OL,7,Funderpins the Isle of Man. And if we
OL,8,Fdon't have tourists, we're not
OL,9,Fgenerating income for the economy."
